 I see a lot of people asking questions which are fairly common knowledge.

1) After the castle there are no down stairs. The only way down is thro'
   trapdoors, or level teleport. 

2) The lowest level in nethack is level 50.

3) In the towers there is always 
  a) An amulet of life saving
  b) An amulet of strangulation
  c) One pair of water walking boots

4) To finish the game one must exit the dungeons with the real amulet of Y

5) The following are major spoilers on WEPONS !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
